{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Following a horrific accident during a routine game of hopping through lanes of traffic with your frog friends, you decide to go try to live normal frog lives and to never speak of that day again. Sounds good, right? The only problem is, sometimes the past has legs and catches up with you . . .\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOOMER SHOOTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/extras/ribbit-and-tear.gif?t=1745690356\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2D ARCADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/extras/arcade.gif?t=1745690356\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3D HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/extras/puzzle.gif?t=1745690356\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be completed in a single sitting (30-40min)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven experience with a little horror, some action, and <strong>plenty</strong> of humor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2D Arcade</strong> gameplay reminiscent of the classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D First-Person</strong> <strong>puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Boomer Shooter FPS action</strong> with a <strong>shotgun</strong> and <strong>BFG (Big Froggin' Gun)!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Note: This is not a full boomer shooter / FPS game. That is only part of the game.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ensemble of characters you'll never frog-get!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-save on each new level for convenience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a story-driven horror action game with 2D and 3D gameplay,<strong> Frog Legs</strong> has a little bit of everything. So grab a cup of flies (or your preferred snack), and hop into this story-driven horror action experience designed to be completed in a single session! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1734110?t=1745690356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1734110?t=1745690356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/097aa63a1c1023c8a37401907753ab1e91efeee8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745690356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/097aa63a1c1023c8a37401907753ab1e91efeee8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745690356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Following a horrific accident during a routine game of hopping through lanes of traffic with your frog friends, you decide to go try to live normal frog lives and to never speak of that day again. Sounds good, right? The only problem is, sometimes the past has legs and catches up with you . . .\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOOMER SHOOTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/extras/ribbit-and-tear.gif?t=1745690356\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2D ARCADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/extras/arcade.gif?t=1745690356\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3D HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/extras/puzzle.gif?t=1745690356\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be completed in a single sitting (30-40min)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven experience with a little horror, some action, and <strong>plenty</strong> of humor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2D Arcade</strong> gameplay reminiscent of the classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D First-Person</strong> <strong>puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Boomer Shooter FPS action</strong> with a <strong>shotgun</strong> and <strong>BFG (Big Froggin' Gun)!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Note: This is not a full boomer shooter / FPS game. That is only part of the game.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ensemble of characters you'll never frog-get!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-save on each new level for convenience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a story-driven horror action game with 2D and 3D gameplay,<strong> Frog Legs</strong> has a little bit of everything. So grab a cup of flies (or your preferred snack), and hop into this story-driven horror action experience designed to be completed in a single session! </p>","developers":["Elliott Dahle"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1734110/header.jpg?t=1745690356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129838,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129838/movie480.mp4?t=1745421252","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129838/movie_max.mp4?t=1745421252"},"name":